  {
    "_comments": [
      "The statuses every shipped type starts with (the design doc, Ian's call of Oct 1): Active (default; writes, visible), Paused (read-only, visible, may change), Closed (read-only, visible, terminal: moves forward only, to Archived), Archived (read-only, hidden, terminal, frozen). A space chooses among its type's statuses and cannot add one; staff holding Configure Space Types add a status to a type."
